     | |  gpio,  |   +--^-----+-+ |                       |                    |   |            |      |    |                      |       
     | |  phy,   |      |     |   |                       |         |          |   |            |  +---v----+----+  +----------+   |       
     | |  etc.)  |      |     |   |                       |                    |   +------------+--+  UFS SCMI   |  | PCIe SCMI|   |       
